#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:295
msgid "Max size of images processed dynamically (pixels)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php:296
msgid ""
"Set the maximum number of pixels (width × height) of the original images "
"processed dynamically, whatever the image processor. For example, 4000000 "
"pixels (4 megapixels, about 2300 × 1700, so a tile is processed in about 25 "
"ms with GD or Imagick).\n"
"Beyond this limit, only tiles and Omeka derivatives are served, so these "
